# D5 task 4.2: the same firmware with ESP-NN's plain C kernels instead of its
# ESP32-S3 assembly, to time the models without the S3's vector instructions.
# Use: NN=ansi sh tools/mtk.sh flash (own build directory and sdkconfig). The
# normal build keeps ESP-NN's default, CONFIG_NN_OPTIMIZED.
# CONFIG_NN_OPTIMIZED is not set
CONFIG_NN_ANSI_C=y
